---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageMasthead from "../components/PageMasthead.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Racquet Habit"
  description="Read how Racquet Habit collects, uses, stores and shares personal information when you browse the site or place an order."
>
  <PageMasthead
    title="Privacy policy"
    intro="This notice explains the limited information used by racquethabit.com and how Fourthwall handles information when you place or manage an order."
    issue="Site policy · Effective 24 July 2026"
  />

  <article class="policy-page">
    <aside><span>Plain-language notice</span><span>Last updated 24 July 2026</span><span>Applies to racquethabit.com</span></aside>
    <div>
      <section><h2>1. Who this notice covers</h2><p>This policy covers the Racquet Habit website at racquethabit.com. Current product checkout, payment, fulfillment and order support are provided by Fourthwall under its own privacy terms. When you leave this site for Fourthwall, its notice applies to the information you provide there.</p></section>
      <section><h2>2. Information this site uses</h2><p>The site stores your display-currency preference, shopping bag and privacy choices in your browser’s local storage. Essential storage stays on your device until you clear it. If you allow analytics, Google Analytics may process pages viewed, shopping interactions, approximate location, device and browser details, referral source and timestamps. If you allow marketing, Meta, TikTok and Pinterest may process page, product, bag and checkout interactions together with campaign, device and browser identifiers. The hosting provider also processes routine request information to deliver and protect the site.</p></section>
      <section><h2>3. Checkout and orders</h2><p>When you proceed to checkout, the product variants and quantities in your bag are used to create a Fourthwall cart. Campaign parameters, pseudonymous analytics identifiers and your site privacy choice may be passed with that cart so the storefront and resulting order can be measured consistently. Racquet Habit does not collect payment-card details on this site. Fourthwall processes order, contact, delivery, payment, tax and support information as merchant and fulfillment partner.</p></section>
      <section><h2>4. Cookies, analytics and advertising</h2><p>Optional tools do not load on racquethabit.com until you make a choice. Analytics consent enables Google Analytics. Marketing consent enables the Meta Pixel, TikTok Pixel and Pinterest tag for campaign measurement, attribution and audience features. Fourthwall has its own privacy choices on the hosted storefront and checkout. Where supported, Fourthwall sends checkout and paid-order events to connected advertising platforms; Pinterest paid-order measurement is sent through a signed server webhook only when the Racquet Habit cart records marketing consent. Pinterest may receive a one-way SHA-256 hash of the checkout email for event matching; the plain email is not sent by Racquet Habit to Pinterest.</p></section>
      <section><h2>5. Sharing and retention</h2><p>Depending on your choices, information is processed by Google, Meta, TikTok and Pinterest under their respective privacy terms. Hosting security logs may be retained by the hosting provider under its operational policies, and order information is retained by Fourthwall according to its legal and service requirements. Each measurement provider controls retention for information it receives; Racquet Habit does not use advertising-event data to make decisions about eligibility, credit, employment, health or other sensitive matters.</p></section>
      <section><h2>6. Your choices</h2><p>Choose “Essential only” to block optional tags, or use “Cookie settings” in the footer at any time to change analytics and marketing choices. Revoking a category stops future events from this site; clearing site data removes the stored choice, bag, currency preference and first-party identifiers accessible to this site. Browser privacy controls or content blockers may further limit measurement. For access, correction or deletion requests concerning an order, use Fourthwall order support. For questions about this site, contact Racquet Habit using the address on the contact page.</p></section>
      <section><h2>7. Changes</h2><p>Material changes will be posted here with a revised date. This notice will be updated when the measurement stack, checkout provider or handling of personal information materially changes.</p></section>
      <a class="paper-button" href="/contact">Privacy question <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
